# A theme that celebrates its agents' moments in full: when Sikemux merges an agent's pull
# request, six bursts of sparks play a second apart along its pane's top and sides. The
# director hands over the moment a core would fold.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
replies sparkle-replies.json
project storefront shop
core saveTheme sparkle.json
prefer themeId custom-sparkle-rice
prefer paneBackdrop theme
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Cache the product pages so a page loads without asking the database each time."
settle 6
front Wren
settle 2
moment Wren show
hold 2.3
snap show
